{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共十三墖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乾隆元年開建墖院於新房村西南\n坡山墖兒崖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共五墖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不及偹載"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大定年建"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明萬歷四十七年賜紫沙門正舍建"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雍正癸卯至戊申"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "監院空忍募造"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雍正己酉至壬子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事紀未詳者闕而待補"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按重蘇叟\n不知其姓氏文雖繁，不便刪削，銘亦可觀，故全錄之耳。"}
