{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十首之四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "桐城"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上幸潭柘念臣英艱於登陟命\n暫留石景山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "潭柘山更幽奇佛刹乃晉唐之\n遺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "潭柘有竹最茂　御製詩\n咏之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下戒壇　幸潭柘命臣士奇於\n馬上聯句二首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "潭柘寺有金元\n碑記佛殿下有龍潭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上幸潭柘寺愛其幽邃吟詩二章雖在豫遊未嘗不在天下蒸黎也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上幸潭柘還道左民人\n携老挈幼聚觀上命勿禁時有獻青李者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八首之一"}
