{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "靜海"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壁間所繪天女維摩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "新造楞嚴壇最為妙麗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏經多出內賜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蘄州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "院中有流觴曲水亭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亭名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "潭柘戒壇戒律精嚴不得飲酒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "居庸涿鹿用寺碑語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "萬壽蟠龍松奇絕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "潭柘\n寺有流盃亭舊名曲水亭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "崇明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按盤\n山志載，徐昌《燕山叢錄》云：薊州甘泉寺有蛇曰小青，龍虬之屬也。與人馴狎，時蟠宿僧榻，\n禱之能致雨。拙菴智朴辨曰：甘泉寺未聞小青禱雨之說，惟西山潭柘寺舊傳潭龍舍宅\n于華嚴祖師衍公，今殿角鴟吻，潭所涌也。龍子，青蛇服，曰傍僧居。又秘魔巖旁有潭，大如\n鬴，覆以巨石，深杳莫測，即當日大小青侍盧師行雨化龍處也。拙菴所辨，最為明晰。今世\n俗所傳，每以盧師大小青事附會潭柘，殊非其實。潭柘藏紅篋中者，寺僧呼曰龍子，又名\n善蟲，隨地皆有，亦隨時可致耳。譚即目比為大小青，亦非其實，故錄盤山志，并附辨之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今勒石貯在大殿內"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "紫柏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為之龍宮所獻，亦為金元故物。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺東"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺西"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺左"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓮花池上。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "象王峯北。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華嚴洞西。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "山門前。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "江家凹上。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺前一里許，秋林紅紫爛熳如繡。西南有洪恩寺平園紅樹，為潭柘十景之一。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺前三里，為遊山必經之道，東有古廟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺南八里。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俱在寺東南十餘里，莊後有昭慶寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東三里，東有觀音洞，北有廣慧寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺西四里，村後一石似龜故名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺西五里，北有小庵。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺西五里。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺西六里，有小廟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺西十餘里。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東南九里，村民剛勇明季奉旨分徙各村。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺嶺東十五里有西峯寺三教庵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東南十八里，有十方院。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東南十六里，有圓照寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東南十八里"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東二十五里，有奉福寺，常住下院進香游山者住宿於此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東南二十二里。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東二十三里。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東二十五里。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東南三十里。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東南二十五里。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東二十五里。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東二十六里。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺東南二十三里。"}
